suggests a mode switch or reset. I will look for points where the magnitude of  
the change in slope is large.                                                   
7.  Format the results clearly, including time points (indices $t$), and the    
corresponding $(x_1, x_2)$ values at those transitions, to help construct an HA 
(Hybrid Automata) model.                                                        
8.  Provide a detailed final answer structured as requested.                    
                                                                                
The time points $t$ will correspond to the array indices, as the data doesn't   
