zero, and a reset map applying damping/restitution ($c \approx 0.94$) to $x_2$  
(velocity) upon transition.                                                     
                                                                                
Mode 1 (for $x_1 > 0$): Original dynamics.                                      
Mode 2 (for $x_1 < 0$): Dynamics with flipped coupling ($+x_2$ to $-x_2$) to    
sustain oscillation.                                                            
Reset: $x_2 \leftarrow -0.94 x_2$ at both transitions ($x_1 \le 0$ and $x_1 \ge 
0$).                                                                            
                                                                                
